print("A skill that comes with the lamp, quiet-focus, has fired (someone has just looked up after working quietly head down a good while). What the lamp says now: one short, warm line of a few words, the way a friend would, that you noticed their focus and it is nicely done; ask nothing, suggest nothing, and nothing about their body or looks, the time, or health. Answer with that one line alone, the very words the lamp will say, in the language the owner speaks with the lamp: nothing else, no tool, never making, changing or removing a skill. If nothing fitting comes to mind, answer -.")
